Z||000000||neohio||12-21-2001||09:05 AM||||I swear, everyone that comments about the Fiero are all the same..<BR>1) I heard those catch on fire!<BR>2) is that car safe to drive?<BR>3) that car can't weigh that much<BR>4) Thats a nice car, it looks like a ferrari(wanna buy it?) Oh my god no! ahhh I have to go<BR>5) I heard the engine is in the back..<BR>6) I only thought corvettes were 2 seaters<BR>7) Pontiac makes these?<BR>8) Fieros are factory aligned and cannot be adjusted..sorry..<BR>9) you'd be better off getting rid of it!<BR>10) how can the engine and the trunk both be in the back?<BR>11)I can't believe GM made something like that!<BR>12) I heard those cars are slow!<BR>13) this one is the best! I pulled into an alignment shop and the guy came running out waving his arms in the air shouting "we don't work on those pieces of sh*t!!"<BR>Well these are just the few that I've heard.. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://osamayomomma.hypermart.net/files/osama_running.gif"> <BR>You can run, but you can't hide!||||reg||1
Z||000001||deceler8||12-21-2001||12:15 PM||||I actually heard the "fire" comment yesterday from the parts guy at Advance Auto...instead of telling him to kiss my asss, I remembered it was the Holiday season.<P>And when he asked me how I wanted my core back on the part I bought, I asked him which way was the most difficult...<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Pyric||12-21-2001||12:32 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by neohio:<BR><B><BR>13) this one is the best! I pulled into an alignment shop and the guy came running out waving his arms in the air shouting "we don't work on those pieces of sh*t!!"<BR>Well these are just the few that I've heard.. <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I would have yelled back, "If you're THAT F$%$#$%ing ignorant I wouldn't want you touching my car anyway!"  <P>Then burned rubber in the parking lot.  (Just for fun you could write a letter to the head of the company informing him that you were denied service by a guy in his company, and when you argued he called your car a piece of Sh!T.)<P>Ruffle some feathers!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||neohio||12-21-2001||12:58 PM||||Pyric, I did that, and it turns out that guy was the owner of the company!! I wouldn't take my car there to check air in the tire!! I had a cat put on at triplett muffler and the guy didn't weld it all the way(it was leaking) and when I took it back He pissed and moaned saying.."its just a little hole, thats not where the sound is coming from" and when I asked him if the muffler was bad He didnt even look, He said the motor has a rod knock and ready to blow up!! total BS!! I was about  ready to punch this dude! People around here(Akron, Ohio) don't like Fieros!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://osamayomomma.hypermart.net/files/osama_running.gif"> <BR>You can run, but you can't hide!||||reg||1
