Z||000008||86 FIERO GT||12-21-2001||06:45 PM||||I went to out local pontiac dealer one saturday, and was talkin to one of the salesman, and he asked was I was there for.  So I told him that I was getting some clips for my GT  and he was like , wow it still runs, I started laughing and said of course its like any other car that runs.  So I went back today in the car and as we were walkin up I heard him say look its a Fiero GT that still running.  I looked at my dad and said "thats the idiot asked me if it still ran" he didn't say nothing about the car again.  HAHA hes a fool.<P>------------------<BR>86 Fiero GT , soon to be N*ed and worked over.||||reg||1
